<title>UK: Nycomed Amersham to seek New York, Oslo listings.</title>
<headline>Nycomed Amersham to seek New York, Oslo listings.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British health and technology group Amersham International Plc said on Tuesday that Nycomed Amersham Plc would be listed in London and seek listings on the Oslo, New York and Copenhagen stock exchanges.</p>
<p>Amersham said earlier it would merge with Norway's Nycomed ASA, creating a global group capitalised at around 1.8 billion stg.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
